<title>UK: Lehman Brothers sets warrants on Nikkei 225 Index.</title>
<headline>Lehman Brothers sets warrants on Nikkei 225 Index.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers Finance SA has issued six million European-style Classic and Plus/Minus range warrants, in six equal tranches, two tranches of Classic range warrants and four tranches of Plus/Minus range warrants, on the Nikkei 225 Index, lead manager Lehman Brothers Bankhaus AG said.</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   27.MAY.97		 PAYDATE	30.AUG.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   FFT STG DDF	     MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> WARRANTS	  RANGE	     ISS PRICE	ANNUAL MAX YIELD</p>
<p> CLASSIC I	 20000-25000     7.50 DEM	  44.40 PCT</p>
<p> CLASSIC II	20500-24500     6.37 DEM	  75.91 PCT</p>
<p> PLUS/MINUS III  20000-24000     5.85 DEM	  94.50 PCT</p>
<p> PLUS/MINUS IV   20500-23500     4.05 DEM	 195.71 PCT</p>
<p> PLUS/MINUS V    20500-24500     4.83 DEM	 142.59 PCT</p>
<p> PLUS/MINUS VI   21000-26000     3.59 DEM	 237.85 PCT</p>
<p> NOTES	     PAY OUT LINKED TO NUMBER OF DAYS THE UNDERLYING</p>
<p>		     REMAINS WITHIN THE RANGE.</p>
<p>-- Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
